{"data":{"target":{"id":"ENSG00000133703","approvedSymbol":"KRAS","functionDescriptions":["Signal transducer in the Ras-MAPK signaling pathway that regulates cell proliferation and survival (PubMed:22711838, PubMed:23698361). Ras proteins bind GDP/GTP and possess intrinsic GTPase activity (PubMed:20949621, PubMed:39809765). Activates MAPK1/MAPK3 resulting in phosphorylation and ultimately degradation of GJA1 (By similarity). Plays a role in promoting oncogenic events by inducing transcriptional silencing of tumor suppressor genes (TSGs) in colorectal cancer (CRC) cells in a ZNF304-dependent manner (PubMed:24623306). Recognized by LZTR1 that mediates its ubiquitination by a BCR (BTB-CUL3-RBX1) E3 ubiquitin-protein ligase complex (PubMed:40934300). {ECO:0000250|UniProtKB:P08644, ECO:0000269|PubMed:20949621, ECO:0000269|PubMed:22711838, ECO:0000269|PubMed:23698361, ECO:0000269|PubMed:24623306, ECO:0000269|PubMed:39809765, ECO:0000269|PubMed:40934300}."],"proteinIds":[{"id":"P01116","source":"uniprot_swissprot"},{"id":"A0A8I5KQ21","source":"uniprot_trembl"},{"id":"A0A8I5KQU3","source":"uniprot_trembl"},{"id":"A0A8I5KR86","source":"uniprot_trembl"},{"id":"A0A8I5KUB5","source":"uniprot_trembl"},{"id":"A0A8I5KXN3","source":"uniprot_trembl"},{"id":"A0A8I5KYH6","source":"uniprot_trembl"},{"id":"A0ABF7PHA5","source":"uniprot_trembl"},{"id":"G3V4K2","source":"uniprot_trembl"},{"id":"G3V5T7","source":"uniprot_trembl"},{"id":"L7RSL8","source":"uniprot_trembl"},{"id":"ENSP00000256078","source":"ensembl_PRO"},{"id":"ENSP00000308495","source":"ensembl_PRO"},{"id":"ENSP00000451856","source":"ensembl_PRO"},{"id":"ENSP00000452512","source":"ensembl_PRO"},{"id":"ENSP00000508568","source":"ensembl_PRO"},{"id":"ENSP00000508921","source":"ensembl_PRO"},{"id":"ENSP00000509223","source":"ensembl_PRO"},{"id":"ENSP00000509238","source":"ensembl_PRO"},{"id":"ENSP00000509798","source":"ensembl_PRO"},{"id":"ENSP00000510254","source":"ensembl_PRO"},{"id":"ENSP00000510431","source":"ensembl_PRO"},